    "preamble": "Shailesh Kumar Pandey And Ors vs The Union Of India And Ors on 22 October, 2024 In The High Court Of Judicature At Patna Civil Writ Jurisdiction Case No.3381 of 2016 ====================================================== Shailesh Kumar Pandey son of Sri N.N. Pandey. Resident of 1/3 Textbook 1. Colony. Keshari Nagar. P.S. Patliputra Colony. District Patna, Proprietor of M/s Nes Neer Aquatic System. Smt. Asha Ranjan wife of Sri Suman Ranjan, Resident of House No. 1/6, Kumar Mansingh Path. Chitragupta Nagar, Kankarbagh, P.S. Patrakarnagar, 2. District Patna, Proprietor of M/s Anshu Kinshu Enterprises, Kankarbagh, Patna. Deepak Jaiswal son of Late Jagdish Choudhary, Resident of 87. Kavi Raman 3. Path, Nageshwar Colony, Boring Road, P.S. Buddha Colony District Patna, Proprietor of M/s Pure and Safe Aqua Industries, Hajipur. Rajesh Kumar son of Sri Satya Narayan Lal, Resident of Gajadhar Chak, 4. Gola Road, P.S. Danapur, District Patna, Managing Director of M/s Adas Development Pvt. Ltd., Gola Road, Danapur, District Patna. Pankaj Kumar Sinha son of Late Vidyapati Sinha, Resident of Bharat 5. Petroleum, 70 ft. Road, Budhjibi Colony, Dasratha, P.S. Beur, District Patna, Partner of M/s Mantra Products, Patna. Amlesh Prasad Singh son of Late Bhullu Prasad Singh, Resident of Mohalla 6. Adityapuri, New Etwarpur, P.O. Kurthaul, P.S. Parsa Bazar, District Patna, Proprietor of M/s Asha Aqua Food and Beverages Products. Praveen Kumar Sharma son of Sri Bhola Sharma, Resident of village and 7. P.O. Waina, P.S. Ghoshi, District Jehanabad, Proprietor of M/s Adi Shakti Mineral Water Udyog, Jehanabad. Rahul Kishore son of Sri Surendra Prasad Singh, Resident of C.C. 34, 8. Peoples Cooperative Colony, P.S. Kankarbagh, District Patna, Proprietor of M/s R. K. Industries, Kankarbagh, Patna Manoj Kumar Chourasia son of Sri Chandrika Prasad, Resident of Pratima Residency, Flat No. 204, Girija Path, New Purandarpur, P.S. Jakkanpur, 9. District Patna, Proprietor of M/s Sarvottam Enterprises, Parsa Bazar, District Patna. ... ... Petitioners Versus The Union of India through the Secretary, Ministry of Food & Consumer 1. Affairs, Government of India, New Delhi. The Secretary, Ministry of Food & Consumer Affairs, Government of India, 2. New Delhi. The Secretary, Ministry of Health and Family Welfare, Government of India, 3. New Delhi. 4. The Bureau of Indian Standards through its Director General, New Delhi. Shailesh Kumar Pandey And Ors vs The Union Of India And Ors on 22 October, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/61674411/ 1 The Director General, Bureau of Indian Standards, Manak Bhawan, 9 5. Bahadur Shah Jafar Marg, New Delhi - 110002. Patna High Court Cwjc No.3381 of 2016(11) dt.22-10-2024 2/2 The Director and Head, Bureau of Indian Standards, Patna Branch Office 6. Patliputra Industrial Estate, Patna - 800013. The Food Safety and Standards Authority of India, New Delhi though its 7. Chairman. The Chief Executive Officer, Food Safety and Standards Authority of In 8. Fda Bhawan, Near Bal Bhawan, Kotla Road, New Delhi - 110002. ... ... Respondents ====================================================== Appearance : For the Petitioners : Mr. Prashant Sinha, Advocate For the Uoi : Mr. Ram Anurag Singh, Cgc For the Bis : Mr. Awadesh Kumar, Advocate For the Fssai : Mr. B. Sharan Pandey, Advocate ==================================================== == CORAM: HONOURABLE JUSTICE SMT. G. ANUPAMA CHAKRAVARTHY ORAL ORDER 11 22-10-2024 1. The Learned counsel for the petitioners intends to withdraw this Writ petition with a liberty to file a fresh Writ petition. (G. Anupama Chakravarthy, J) Shanu/- U Shailesh Kumar Pandey And Ors vs The Union Of India And Ors on 22 October, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/61674411/ 2",
